              "Under <strong>Article 12</strong>, the term \"State\" includes:<br/>1. The Government and Parliament of India (Central executive and legislature),<br/>2. The Government and Legislature of each State,<br/>3. All local authorities (such as Municipal Corporations, Panchayats, and Port Trusts), and<br/>4. <strong>All other authorities</strong> within the territory of India or under the control of the Government of India."
